  "title": "Chili with Ziti",
  "description": "Spicy chili with ground beef, onion, garlic, and kidney beans simmered in tomato sauce. Seasoned with oregano and cinnamon. Served over ziti pasta and topped with Cheddar cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Michelle"
  ],
